# target/plot/pen are archetype masks gating each statement to its sub-world.
# attackers is the inverse read of targets, spelled as an explicit srel (inv needs a
# clear the Pen archetype mask; livestock = inv penOf. headcount and target back the
# `Pen , Headcount = #/ livestock'` and `Target , Hits += #/ attackers'` statements,
